WEBVTT

00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:31.956
where literally my heart rate goes up

00:03:31.996 --> 00:03:34.676
and I might start sweating a little bit

00:03:34.716 --> 00:03:36.916
and I'm just not feeling as well.

00:03:37.676 --> 00:03:43.076
Now, what we're meant to do
is to come back to equilibrium

00:03:43.076 --> 00:03:45.356
when a stressor goes away.

00:03:45.356 --> 00:03:47.916
That's the way the body
is supposed to work.

00:03:48.276 --> 00:03:54.876
But what happens if I go home
at the end of my upsetting day

00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:57.716
and I have somebody to talk to?

00:03:58.436 --> 00:04:01.796
Either I can call someone on the phone
or it's somebody I live with.